   "type": "text",
   "x": 206.83999999999997,
   "y": 1458.75,
   "width": 796.32,
   "height": 112.5,
   "text": "THE MOMENT (the demo opens here)\nNurse fired Oct 15, but her timesheet shows 32 more hours, and her bank account\nchanged 2 days before she was fired. No single system looks wrong on its own.\nThe agent holds just her paycheck, runs a fraud check, asks HR and her manager,\nand explains its reasoning when a judge asks \"why?\"",
   "originalText": "THE MOMENT (the demo opens here)\nNurse fired Oct 15, but her timesheet shows 32 more hours, and her bank account\nchanged 2 days before she was fired. No single system looks wrong on its own.\nThe agent holds just her paycheck, runs a fraud check, asks HR and her manager,\nand explains its reasoning when a judge asks \"why?\"",
